This repository contains code under different terms. Each part keeps the terms of its authors.

0. ROMs (src/roms/, also packed into quadspeccyx4.kg)
   ------------------------------------------------------
   128.rom, 48.rom: the ZX Spectrum 128 / 48 ROMs, copyright (c) Amstrad plc, not covered by the MIT license below
   and no license to them is granted here. Amstrad allows them to be distributed with emulators, without charge for
   them. They are included, as with emulators and other FPGA cores, so that the core works out of the box.

   esxdos089.bin: the DivMMC ROM of esxDOS 0.8.9, copyright (c) Papaya Dezign (esxdos.org), not covered by the MIT
   license below and no license to it is granted here. esxDOS is distributed by its authors free of charge; the
   ROM is included unchanged, as with other FPGA cores with DivMMC, and is also packed into quadspeccyx4.kg. The
   SYS / BIN files esxDOS needs on the SD card are not in this repository: take them from the esxDOS 0.8.9
   distribution (esxdos089.zip, esxdos.org).

1. tv80 (src/rtl/tv80/)
   --------------------
   tv80: copyright (c) 2004 Guy Hutchison, under the MIT-style license in the header of each file (the copy of
   karabas_go_v6z80p with its fixes, through karabas-go-core-quadspeccy). tv80_oct.v and the generated
   tv80o_core.v / tv80o_reg.v are derived from it and keep that license. The headers must be kept.

2. karabas-go-modules (modules/, a git submodule)
   ----------------------------------------------
   Andy Karpov and contributors: the terms of that repository. src/rtl/video/hdmi_enc.vhd is a copy of its
   zhdmi_tx.vhd (Francois Galea, Andy Karpov) without the serializers: GNU GPL v3 or later, as its header says.
   src/rtl/video/osd_overlay.v is a copy of its kg_l2_osd_overlay.v with a horizontal scale of its own.

